  "instructions": [
    "heat the coconut oil in a clay pot over medium heat",
    "add the sliced onion and cook until translucent",
    "add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "add the diced tomato and cook for 5 minutes",
    "add the paprika, cumin, salt, and black pepper. stir well",
    "add the jasmine rice, vinegar, water, and lime juice. mix well",
    "bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and cover the pot",
    "cook for 15 minutes or until the rice is tender and the liquid is absorbed",
    "fluff the rice with a fork and garnish with fresh cilantro",
    "serve hot",
    "enjoy!"
